	Connect a channel to a dispatcher
apifn	sm_channel_dispatcher_connect
params	sm_channel_dispatcher_connect_parms dp
	The dispatcher to which the channel should pass data
field	tSMDispatcherId dest in
	The channel that will produce the data
field	tSMChannelId channel in
unstruct
	Connects an input channel to a dispatcher, replacing the
	previous dispatcher connected to it. The
ref	dest
	must be a dispatcher created by a call to
fnref	sm_udp_dispatcher_create.
	or the value <code>kSMNullDispatcherId</code>.
	The input channel, 
ref	channel,
	will use data dispatcher to pass on data it produces
	(e.g. for record or receive operations).
	<p>
	There must be no operation in progress (e.g. record) on the input
	half of the channel when this function is called.
	<p>
	The default dispatcher for a channel is
	<code>kSMNullDispatcherId</code>, which dispatches data through
	the API (e.g. via
fnref	smdc_rx_data).
explain
	0
retval
error	ERR_SM_DEVERR - device error

